         ("Evaluation practice: different finetuning hyperparameters had a large effect on length generalization while barely changing in-distribution performance, which the authors call surprising; in-distribution performance therefore did not indicate OOD length generalization in these finetuning experiments.",
          "Introduction (contributions)",
          "Surprisingly, different hyperparameter choices for ﬁnetuning have a large effect on length generalization performance, while having minimal effect on the ﬁnal in-distribution performance (Section 3.3)."),
